          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "Notwithstanding the preceding requirements of this paragraph, a person may:\n\n(i) Be held by an adult, except as outlined in § 91.108(j), who is occupying an approved seat or berth, provided that the person being held has not reached his or her second birthday and does not occupy or use any restraining device;"
