        "@value": "A person on board a U.S.-registered civil aircraft during movement on the surface, takeoff, and landing, provided that the person being held has not reached his or her second birthday, does not occupy or use any restraining device, the adult is occupying an approved seat or berth, and not excluded by § 91.108(j).",
