,\"quote\":\"( 4 ) Except as provided in § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)( 3 )( iii ) and § 91.\",\"start\":4019}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:63a07c24f37319e8ed5936984b947b7734432e98d1ab127bd04f603728dc4f64\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a28000c54f7260ba360d2ae8ef10d4a5acf84c2aef54a30c7d66461fd5b83eec\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"are not approved\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:49d548fbe06fa5969005dd91967a11685490a8ce09ed44873478864379eeaad8\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"( 4 ) Except as provided in § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)( 3 )( iii ) and § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)( 3 )( iv ), booster-type child restraint systems (as defined in Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard No. 213 (49 CFR 571.213)), vest- and harness-type child restraint systems, and lap held child restraints are not approved for use in aircraft; and\",\"references\":[\"§ 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)( 3 )( iii )\",\"§ 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)( 3 )( iv )\",\"Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard No. 213 (49 CFR 571.213)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:977dff958248066b3c135daa2a0dde37412628820635f8dc14044982ac5a81a7\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"( 4 ) Except as provided in § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)( 3 )( iii ) and § 91.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Except as provided in § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)(3)(iii) and § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)(3)(iv).\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":4019,\"summary\":\"Except as provided in § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)(3)(iii) and § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(B)(3)(iv), booster-type child restraint systems (as defined in Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard No. 213 (49 CFR 571.213)), vest- and harness-type child restraint systems, and lap held child restraints are not approved for use in aircraft.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]