 of this section provided that:\",\"(C) The operator complies with the following requirements:\"],\"scope_text\":\"When a child restraint system is occupied under paragraph (a)(3)(iii).\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":4359,\"summary\":\"When a child restraint system is used under 14 CFR § 91.107(a)(3)(iii), the operator must ensure that the restraint system is properly secured to an approved forward-facing seat or berth.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
