      "oa:hasSelector": [
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(C) The operator complies with the following requirements:\n\n( 1 ) The restraint system must be properly secured to an approved forward-facing seat or berth;\n\n( 2 ) The child must be properly secured in the restraint system and must not exceed the specified weight limit for the restraint system; and"
